{"unit_id":"siqyka__dsh-ssh-workspace#card-zh","repo":"siqyka/dsh-ssh-workspace","commit":"39645c594d28036a66b91e6b10bcadb8213ec1ea","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-workspace 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 SSH 远程工作区插件。它把 ssh:// 主机别名和远端目录路由到 SFTP 文件系统，并接入 DSH 的工作区、文件工具与命令执行服务。用户可浏览并挂载远端目录，在远端读写文件、执行命令、传输文件，也可把远端端口转发到本机预览服务。适合需要在 DSH 中直接处理服务器项目的人；需要配置可访问的 SSH 主机及认证信息，远端搜索和变更追踪分别使用 ripgrep 与 git。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-14","lib/index.js:260-266","lib/remote-fs.js:4-12","lib/tools.js:1410-1417"]}
{"unit_id":"siqyka__dsh-ssh-workspace#card-en","repo":"siqyka/dsh-ssh-workspace","commit":"39645c594d28036a66b91e6b10bcadb8213ec1ea","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ssh-workspace adds SSH workspaces to DSH Web. It routes ssh:// paths through SFTP for remote files and command execution. Users can mount directories, transfer files, and forward ports. Configure an SSH host and credentials; remote search and change tracking use ripgrep and git.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-14","lib/index.js:260-266","lib/remote-fs.js:4-12","lib/tools.js:1410-1417"]}
